# --- Secrets / local config (Round #1195 A-2) ---
# Real credentials must NEVER be committed. The previous .env leak is
# documented in .agent/brain/NOTES.md (Round #1195); the leaked DB
# password must be rotated at the DB and `git filter-repo` considered
# for the pre-fix history.
